'''Ravenshire''' is an [[Alliance]]-aligned port town located in eastern [[Gilneas]]. It is one of the oldest towns in Gilneas and is sworn to the lords of [[Ravenwood Keep]], though with the recent destruction of the Keep, [[Lord Darius Ravenwood]] has moved his court to Ravenshire.<ref>[[Historian Samuel Ravencrest#Quotes]]</ref> In the center of the town is erected the [[Gilneas Memorial Stone]], a monument in memory of fallen Gilnean soldiers.

